+
+A published board can be viewed by anyone with its public URL, without signing in. Only account administrators can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board. Publishing a board that is already published keeps its existing public URL.
